================================================================================
1. DEFINITIONS AND SCOPE OF COVERED WORK
================================================================================
This License governs all intellectual property, materials, assets, and concepts 
associated with "Quantum-Walk Enhanced, Parrondo-Driven Decision Trees" (herein 
referred to as "QWEPDT"), created and authored by Georgios-Marios Merkouris 
(geormerk), whether published in this repository, associated repositories, 
pre-prints, or publications. 

The "Covered Work" explicitly encompasses, without limitation:
  a. THE ALGORITHMIC CONCEPTS AND LOGIC: The conceptual model, mathematical 
     foundations, formulations, coin/shift quantum-walk dynamics, Parrondo-game 
     mechanisms, branching/splitting criteria, state updates, pseudocode, and 
     hybrid stochastic logic governing QWEPDT.
  b. SOURCE CODE AND IMPLEMENTATIONS: All source code, scripts, compiled binaries, 
     libraries, tests, configuration files, and software implementations in any 
     programming language.
  c. VISUAL AND STRUCTURAL ASSETS: All flowcharts, architecture diagrams, state 
     transition diagrams, circuit analogies, plots, schemas, visual workflows, 
     and graphical representations of QWEPDT.
  d. DOCUMENTATION AND METHODOLOGIES: All written specifications, design notes, 
     technical methodologies, training pipelines, data preparation workflows, 
     and associated documentation.

